        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="about-card">

                <h3>Professional Profile</h3>

                <p>
                    I am a researcher working at the intersection of polymer
                    science, electrochemistry, membrane technology and
                    hydrogen energy.
                </p>

                <br>

                <p>
                    My research involves the design, synthesis,
                    characterization and application of functional polymers
                    and polymer electrolyte membranes for energy conversion,
                    hydrogen production and gas separation technologies.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="about-card">

                <h3>Academic Background</h3>

                <p>
