<!-- ================= RESEARCH ================= -->

<section id="research">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

            <span>Research</span>

            <h2>Research Areas</h2>

            <p>
                Development of advanced polymeric materials for energy,
                electrochemical and separation applications.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="research-list">

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Hydrogen Energy</strong><br>
                Polymer electrolyte membranes, hydrogen production and
                electrochemical energy conversion.
            </div>

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Fuel Cells</strong><br>
                Proton exchange membrane fuel cells and anion exchange
                membrane fuel cells, including membrane electrode assemblies.
            </div>

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Water Electrolysis</strong><br>
                Development of low-cost and high-performance polymer
                electrolyte membranes for hydrogen generation.
            </div>

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Carbon Capture & Separation</strong><br>
                Development of robust polymeric membranes for CO₂ separation
                and sequestration.
            </div>

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Membrane Technology</strong><br>
                Nanofiltration membranes, ion-exchange membranes and
                advanced polymeric membrane architectures.
            </div>

            <div class="research-item">
                <strong>Advanced Polymer Materials</strong><br>
                Polymer synthesis, molecular design, interpenetrating polymer
                networks, functional polymers and nanocomposite membranes.
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


